  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Ocean Biodiversity Initiative (GOBI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOBI was an international partnership of organisations committed to advancing the scientific basis for conserving biological diversity in the marine environment. GOBI partners, coordinated by a dedicated Secretariat, developed methods, generated new data, and delivered actionable knowledge to address present-day concerns of the biodiversity management and conservation community. GOBI also supported countries in meeting their national conservation obligations, devising sustainable marine management measures via cooperation between GOBI partners, CBD signatory states and intergovernmental organisations. These activities helped society and its leaders appreciate the value of marine biodiversity and contribute towards transformational policy advice and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
